WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Zhang Yi kept talking and refused to send supplies at all.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,000
I don’t know who Zhang Yi is

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,400
Don't mention this person to me again

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,800
He can't do it. Don't you have other suitors?

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
That Zhou Peng in the warehouse has his heart set on you.

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,180
He can't even afford a house

7
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,980
At most, it can be considered a make-up quilt.

8
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,780
Now it’s snowing and the door is closed, so you can’t buy anything to eat.

9
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,980
It would be better to find him first to get some good luck.

10
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:25,050
Yu Qing, just tell me what you want.

11
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:26,650
I'll do anything for you

12
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:29,250
Thank you Zhou Peng. You are so kind.

13
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:31,650
With your condition, I deserve to like you.

14
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:34,740
The entire community will be cut off from water and electricity.

15
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,340
The show starts soon
